{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-signin-springfestival",
  "id": "source-25640",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "25640001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "花灯已陪你赏过了，现在是时候犒劳一下你的胃了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25640002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "说吧，今天想吃点什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "25640004",
              "text": "不是应该吃元宵吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "25640003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25640004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "呵呵，看得出来|101|是一位非常喜爱传统习俗的人呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25640005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "元宵虽然是一种很常见的家常美食，可想要做得好吃却并非那么简单的事情。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25640006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "从元宵皮的选料，再到馅的调制，每一个环节的工序都是十分繁琐的呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "25640008",
              "text": "好麻烦，不如吃速冻的吧。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "25640007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25640008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "那怎么能行！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25640009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "今天的日子这么特别，想要重来一次的话，那可要等到明年的今日了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25640010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "珍惜当下、享受当下，让今天不留遗憾，才是我们应该有的态度。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "25640012",
              "text": "唔，都听你的。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "25640011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25640012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "这才对嘛，尽管会有一番辛苦，不过吃到手作的元宵，滋味绝对是超值的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25640013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "元宵是我唯一会制作的一道美食，可惜我已经好久没有下厨了，手生是肯定的啦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25640014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "所以你会一直在旁边协助我，直到我完成的，对吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25640015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然，我们开始吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
